Z||000010||FieroSTETZ||11-13-2000||07:51 PM||||well, fiero5, i am trying to compile all the fiero sound and video clips i can get, and put them on a cd with an html based menu system. SO, if anyone has videos or fiero sounds, email them to me, or let me know some how where they are. if you have a tape recorder and no way to put it on the computer, fill a tape with lots of sounds and such, and I will copy it and send it back, or buy it from you. same with 8mm or vhs video cassettes. i still need sounds of turbos, iron dukes, quad4's, 3400's, 3800's, and v-8 fieros. got LOTS of stock ones. i need to find a place with lots of accessible web space to store all the stuff i have. i currently have an ftp site, but my isp limits guests to 30k/sec max. (my downstream is 1,700k/sec). and they don't like customers serving ftps. if anyone wants, i will give them a logon and password for my ftp, as i cannot allow anonymous access.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1012904&a=7460599&p=25516673"> ||||reg||1
